1
00:00:00,740 --> 00:00:02,410
D2.

2
00:00:02,410 --> 00:00:08,065
Read Kitty's article about her best friend.

3
00:00:08,065 --> 00:00:11,720
My best friend.

4
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:14,870
My best friend is Joan.

5
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:19,830
I met her at a dance club five years ago.

6
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:22,740
Joan is taller than me.

7
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:25,850
Her hair is long and soft.

8
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:29,760
I like her bright smiling eyes.

9
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:33,730
They make her look pretty and kind.

10
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:37,300
Joan is helpful and patient.

11
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:46,080
Sometimes I cannot do well in our dance class and she is always kind to give me help.

12
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:49,450
Joan is caring and thoughtful.

13
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:58,150
I often tell her when something worries me and she always tries to help and keeps it secret.

14
00:00:58,150 --> 00:01:02,060
Joan is also a cheerful person.

15
00:01:02,060 --> 00:01:05,540
She likes to look on the bright side.

16
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:10,540
Every time I feel down she will cheer me up.

17
00:01:10,540 --> 00:01:17,050
I think Joan is great and I hope we will be best friends forever.
